<v Speaker 1>In Surah Al-Mulk, he says, Tabaaraka ladi biyadi hil mulk wa hua'ala kuli shayinu qadeer Blessed is the one whose hand has the ultimate dominion and is able to do everything.

157
00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:57.790
<v Speaker 1>Alladi khalaqal mawta wal hayata liyabluwaqum ayyukum ahsanu 'Amala Who created death and life to test you and see which of you is the best in action.

158
00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:28.270
<v Speaker 1>according to the Quran this world was never meant for justice according to the Quran this life is a test and this world that we live in is an examination hall and everyone is being tested some with poverty some with wealth some with sickness some with health in fact the healthy and the rich

159
