00:20:41.710 --> 00:20:51.150
<v Speaker 1>And this is why it's no surprise that the greatest man to walk the face of this earth, Rasulullah , he chose poverty over riches.

163
00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.950
<v Speaker 1>But the point is that this world is imperfect

164
