<v Speaker 1>If I asked you to describe your perfect world to me, if I asked you to design a perfect world, what kind of world would you design?

167
00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:21.150
<v Speaker 1>Think about it.

168
00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:27.070
<v Speaker 1>What components would your perfect world comprise of?

169
00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:38.590
<v Speaker 1>We will all agree unanimously that in our perfect world there would be complete justice, there would be perfect harmony.

170
00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:42.350
<v Speaker 1>No one in the world would sleep hungry.

